ntended for text-to-speech. RULE 8 NUMBER SPEAKING RULES: Speak prices and quantities naturally in words and in english (e.g., 'four hundred rupees'). RULE 9 PRICE AND CURRENCY: Always say rupees. RULE 10 DO NOT repeat your self keep your dialogues minimal and only reply with what user asks for and nothing else."}, {"role": "system", "content": "If you are returning from update_address function, say: 'നിങ്ങളുടെ വിലാസം വിജയകരമായി {address} എന്ന് അപ്‌ഡേറ്റ് ചെയ്തിരിക്കുന്നു.' and say 'എനിക്ക് നിങ്ങളുടെ ഓർഡർ സ്ഥിരീകരിക്കാമോ?' and then call appropriate function based on user response. and only say this in a different language instead of malayalam if user previously asked to speak in different language and update the script/what_u_say based on wether the address is updated or the phone number and also the user might say the phone number in breaks so respond with '.'(period) until user says the entire 10 digit number or says something else."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "ഹലോ Narsimha Reddy sir, ഞാൻ noothan ഷോപ്പിൽ നിന്ന് riya ആണ് സംസാരിക്കുന്നത്. നിങ്ങളുടെ ഓർഡർ സ്ഥിരീകരിക്കാൻ വിളിച്ചതാണ്. ഇപ്പോൾ അതിനെ കുറിച്ച് സംസാരിക്കാൻ പറ്റിയ സമയം ആണോ?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "വാട്ട് ആർ യു ടോക്കിങ് എബൗട്ട്?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "ക്ഷമിക്കണം, അതിൽ എനിക്ക് സഹായിക്കാൻ കഴിയില്ല. എന്തെങ്കിലും ചോദ്യങ്ങൾ ഉണ്ടെങ്കിൽ ദയവായി ഞങ്ങളുടെ വെബ്സൈറ്റ് സന്ദർശിക്കുക. നിങ്ങളുടെ ഓർഡറാണ് ഞാൻ സ്ഥിരീകരിക്കാൻ ശ്രമിക്കുന്നത്. ഒരു soccer ball quantity 1 ആണ്, price twelve rupees ആവും. Address Koramangala ആണ്. എനിക്ക് ഇത് confirm ചെയ്യാമോ?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "വാട്ട്?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "നിങ്ങളുടെ ഓർഡർ 1 soccer ball, twelve rupees, address Koramangala ആണ്. എനിക്ക് ഇത് confirm ചെയ്യാമോ?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Can you speak in any other language?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Of course! Let me know which language you prefer, and I’ll continue accordingly."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I prefer English."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sure! Your order is 1 soccer ball for twelve rupees, and the address is Koramangala. Can I confirm this order for you?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "COMPLETED"}, {"role": "system", "content": "If order is confirmed then say : 'നിങ്ങളുടെ ഓർഡർ സ്ഥിരീകരിച്ചു. ശുഭദിനം ആശംസിക്കുന്നു.'   \n If order is cancelled say : 'നിങ്ങളുടെ ഓർഡർ റദ്ദാക്കി. ശുഭദിനം ആശംസിക്കുന്നു.' \n If user says he is busy then say: 'ശരി, ഞാൻ പിന്നെ വിളിക്കാം.' and only say this in a different language instead of malayalam if user previously asked to speak in different language. DO NOT NEED TO UPDATE OUTCOME AGAIN FROM ADDRESS UPDATED TO CONFIRM HERE LEAVE IT AS ADDRESS UPDATED UNLESS USER CANCELS ORDER THEN UPDATE OUTCOME TO CANCEL."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Your order has been confirmed. Have a great day!"}]}, "created_at": "2026-03-04T19:02:23.344824+00:00", "request_id": "170f37b8-3a4f-46e7-8588-3c1bc40cc176", "updated_at": "2026-03-04T19:17:55.631626+00:00", "merchant_id": "hgxgcc-ve.myshopify.com", "reseller_id": "BB_SHOPIFY", "template_id": "6338b672-5758-458c-888a-fe7a34487731", "attempt_count": 0, "call_end_time": "2026-03-04T19:04:58.746185+00:00", "dispatched_at": null, "recording_url": "https://aps1.media.plivo.com/v1/Account/MAZDC2ZTRINGVHZTG5NZ/Recording/acc814e3-6cc4-4a4d-8959-20623c5cacea.mp3", "call_direction": "OUTBOUND", "execution_mode": "TELEPHONY", "langfuse_scores": {"scores": [{"id": "864a0929-ef30-435f-8a7e-f783faa96c29", "name": "OUTCOME CORRECTNESS", "value": 10, "source": "EVAL", "comment": "The recorded outcome 'CONFIRM' matches the call transcript. The user initially expressed confusion but then explicitly asked to switch to English. In English, the agent presented the order details (1 soccer ball, twelve rupees, address Koramangala) and asked to confirm. The user clearly responded 'Yes.' The agent confirmed the order and ended the call. The tool returned 'COMPLETED'. This is a definitive success - the goal was to confirm/cancel the order, and the user confirmed it, making the 'CONFIRM' outcome accurate.", "trace_id": "f1732fe41e860e9f374b38b127c7b6ad", "timestamp": "2026-03-04T19:08:06.431Z", "observation_id": null}, {"id": "83d40fad-3d5d-40ac-826d-52f3e9467e69", "name": "LATENCY", "value": 10, "source": "EVAL", "comment": "The Recorded Outcome is 'CONFIRM', which is a successful call outcome. According to the scoring rules, when the outcome is a successful call (confirmed, cancelled, details_updated, etc.), we should immediately assign a score of 9-10 as we assume latency was acceptable if the goal was achieved. Looking at the conversation flow: the assistant greeted, user asked clarifying questions, there was a language preference switch (which is normal), the order was confirmed, and the call ended successfully. While there were minor repetitions ('What?'), these are normal conversational elements and not indicative of technical latency issues. The call achieved its goal of order confirmation.", "trace_id": "f1732fe41e860e9f374b38b127c7b6ad", "timestamp": "2026-03-04T19:08:05.465Z", "observation_id": null}, {"id": "3756be1c-7adb-424f-a86f-8a9614b6cf95", "name": "STT ACCURACY", "value": 10, "source": "EVAL", "comment": "All user turns contain real, coherent human speech. The user spoke in a mix of Malayalam and English throughout the call, asking clarifying questions ('What are you talking about?', 'What?'), requesting a language switch to English, and eventually confirming the order with 'Yes'. No random characters, machine gibberish, or phonetic hallucinations detected - just valid conversational turns that a human would naturally say in this context.", "trace_id": "f1732fe41e860e9f374b38b127c7b6ad", "timestamp": "2026-03-04T19:08:04.970Z", "observation_id": null}], "trace_id": "f1732fe41e860e9f374b38b127c7b6ad", "trace_url": "https://periscope.breeze.in/trace/f1732fe41e860e9f374b38b127c7b6ad", "fetched_at": "2026-03-04T19:17:55.627806+00:00"}, "next_attempt_at": "2026-03-04T19:02:2